    "FrontBlockade.02": {
      "sha256": "ec5a3ebad4906fe4025f00012ff15aa1d7ff9155d689266f93afbedbd88a2ac8",
      "transcript": "走过,盯一下,我们去拉右边。",
      "cer": 0.3636,
      "note": "周哥→走过（zhou/zou、ge/guo）、顶→盯、拿→拉，同音/近音。"
    },
    "FrontBlockade.03": {
