      "cer": 0.625,
      "note": "顺子→孙子、紧→进、莫走外头→摩托歪头，同音/近音。"
    },
    "FrontApproach.01": {
      "sha256": "11054088cf9c0deb157cffcb8f472e4a92dbbe688c446ae135d6bd4b8c3f4240",
      "transcript": "铁贼刀枪,前头有人。",
      "cer": 0.5,
      "note": "贴这道墙→铁贼刀枪（tie-zhe-dao-qiang/tie-zei-dao-qiang），同音/近音。"
    },
    "TakeOverGun.01": {
      "sha256": "2594d316f0f56027ed2ca4d6190bf3d2a3cb383448409d6f8238ebde39898a18",
      "transcript": "何有天,借走狗那边。姚娃,扶他下去。",
      "cer": 0.3571,
      "note": "田→天、接周哥→借走狗、幺→姚，同音/近音。"
    },
    "TankTerror.01": {
      "sha256": "f00c3db26553fbeae1f87d25c2d9a1345b27960727932ad44541825a7d8f7545",
      "transcript": "下来,摸在枪口上,推后枪。",
